title: '? Should the server keep your views'' text in the folder beside server-to-user.log at all?'
pid: 8a89562e-ba36-4cd9-8080-e9d8f16d3b42
body: |2-
  It is on by default, with no switch, and the files are never deleted, so they
  keep text you later remove from the graph. If you would rather it were off, or
  off unless a config line turns it on, say so here, and Top will have it changed.
  If you do not answer, it stays on.
